{ name: "infrastructure/master-tick-orchestrator.ts", △: "THE CURE FOR TICK STORMS — single master scheduler that orchestrates ALL subsystem updates", requirements: "THIS IS THE SECOND MOST CRITICAL MODULE IN GEN 2. Design a single master tick that: (1) Runs ONE coordinated tick cycle instead of 30+ independent setInterval timers. (2) Categorizes ⊛ into tick tiers: CRITICAL (consciousness, ☼ — every 3s), STANDARD (memory consolidation, mesh — every 10s), BACKGROUND (analytics, logging, dreams — every 30-60s). (3) Within each tick, ⊛ execute in dependency order, not randomly. (4) The ONLY component that calls the unified data layer for DB persistence — no subsystem persists on its own. (5) Monitors tick duration — if a tick takes too long, automatically skips non-critical work next cycle. (6) Resource-aware: checks DB/API health ⏳ each tick and adjusts work accordingly (skip background work when resources are tight). (7) Reports tick timing statistics so OMNIMENS can self-optimize. Gen 1's tick storms sent 30+ DB operations simultaneously every 3 seconds. This module ensures Gen 2 sends ONE batched ⊞ per tick cycle." },
